%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Grizzly
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 5
  entries:
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Trigger Bombs
    AbilityDescription: 'LT and RT each own a bomb in Explosives: pull and release to fire it, sized by how hard you squeezed; pull again to freeze it; let go to blow it. A blast you sit in throws you forward along your nose and the speed lasts two seconds, so bombs chain into a flow. Space and the level-5 upgrade still belong to the charged cannon, which has no button since the bombs moved to the triggers.'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Safe Detonation
    UpgradeDescription: Friendly fire off - your explosions no longer damage allied
      vessels or your own domain's prisms. Self-propulsion is unaffected.
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Weapon Systems
    AbilityDescription: 'Y (or LB) cycles three weapons and the triggers follow: Explosives (a bomb on each trigger), the plasma claw (LT the left claw, RT the right; pressure sizes it, letting go slashes it down and across) and the sniper (LT scope with pressure zoom, RT fire). Every enemy prism the claw lights refills your energy, and Mass sets how much (2.5x at level 10). At level 5 the claw stops destroying what it burns and STEALS it for your team.'
    Input: 14
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Claimed Fire
    UpgradeDescription: The plasma claw stops destroying what it burns - a prism
      that burns out now joins your domain instead, converting enemy volume into
      your own. The claw itself is available from the start.
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Dig In
    AbilityDescription: 'Stop to dig in and BRACE - while planted, energy regenerates faster, x2 at rest and x5 at level 10. Dig in, refill, rush out. Level 5 grants battlefield sight while dug in.'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Battle Sight
    UpgradeDescription: While dug in, every rival vessel within range is marked
      in its own domain colour, through mass.
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Rush
    AbilityDescription: Spend energy to RAM forward - for the length of the burst
      the hull smashes every rival prism it ploughs into (plain and shielded;
      super-shielded mass holds). Time refills a spent rush faster, 6 s at rest
      and 2.5 s at level 10. At level 5 the ram follows your nose.
    Input: 7
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Vector Control
    UpgradeDescription: The ram follows your nose - turn mid-rush and the charge
      turns with you, carving a curved swathe instead of a straight one.
